+ *         <li>SkipDatum --&gt; DocSkip, DocFPSkip, &lt;PosFPSkip, PosBlockOffset, PayLength?,
+ *             PayFPSkip?&gt;?, ImpactLength, &lt;CompetitiveFreqDelta, CompetitiveNormDelta?&gt;
