+ *
+ * <pre>
+ * 0 1 2 3 4 5
+ * d d d d d d    (posting list)
+ *     ^     ^    (skip point in MultiLeveSkipWriter)
+ *       ^        (skip point in Lucene90SkipWriter)
+ * </pre>
+ *
